{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T01:01:50+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Forest Plague", "steam_appid": 935450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/935450/extras/8fc12a03599e9f9c85447c5f424c94c4.avif?t=1643379703\" width=600 height=340 /></span><br><br>This forest has one key difference from the hundreds of other places. Here the HUNTER becomes the HUNTED. And animals here pose great danger.<br><br>For some reason, these animals aren’t afraid of humans anymore. Something - RADIATION? VIRUSES? DNA shift? - has made them too wild and bloodthirsty, so they will chase and devour you unless you protect yourself with a good deal of weapons.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/935450/extras/24b6da8df3524c236965bb66b2dc4795.avif?t=1643379703\" width=600 height=340 /></span><br><br>You are to put an end to this forest plague. There is no other way:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>SURVIVE the battle with animals that come in waves as long as you can;<br></li><li>PROTECT yourself with the most effective weapons.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forest Plague survival game key features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Incredible top-down-shooter for thrill-seekers;<br></li><li>Hordes of aggressive animals;<br></li><li>Different mighty weapons;<br></li><li>Only one chance to survive in this chaos.</li></ul><br>Get out alive and save the forest from this PLAGUE!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/935450/extras/11dd5c5c79b50841127ae1bb1ae5df58.avif?t=1643379703\" width=600 height=340 /></span>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a